{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 2D pixel style aircraft carrier deck management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will become a ground crew member with different functions on the deck of China's third aircraft carrier, the Fujian, commanding the transportation, refueling, ammunition loading, takeoff, and landing of carrier based aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy doesn't know when they will appear, and all you need to do is prepare the fighter jets on the deck as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.poster.avif?t=1765174059\" width=544 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.webm?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.mp4?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced time management game. Time is life, you need to make decisions quickly and give accurate commands. Don't repeat the indecisiveness of a commander who lost three aircraft carriers in five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.poster.avif?t=1765174059\" width=544 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.webm?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.mp4?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains multiple fictional historical combat missions. Helps you familiarize and understand game operations and core gameplay in the early stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, it also includes three different difficulty levels of endless modes, where enemies will attack wave after wave, and you can see how long you can lead this giant ship to persist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave of enemies is cleared, a random gain reward will appear, which helps to complete battles more efficiently in subsequent waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to enhancing the work efficiency of ground personnel, the participation and assistance of new models of fighter jets such as J35 and KJ600 can also be obtained.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027740?t=1765174059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027740?t=1765174059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/d073ee15b0f42e37d0ea5a4464e2d84dac5beff1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765174059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/d073ee15b0f42e37d0ea5a4464e2d84dac5beff1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765174059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4204910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 2D pixel style aircraft carrier deck management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will become a ground crew member with different functions on the deck of China's third aircraft carrier, the Fujian, commanding the transportation, refueling, ammunition loading, takeoff, and landing of carrier based aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy doesn't know when they will appear, and all you need to do is prepare the fighter jets on the deck as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.poster.avif?t=1765174059\" width=544 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.webm?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/7d60c6d7a52e3387fffc00d4991e75b9.mp4?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced time management game. Time is life, you need to make decisions quickly and give accurate commands. Don't repeat the indecisiveness of a commander who lost three aircraft carriers in five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.poster.avif?t=1765174059\" width=544 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.webm?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/e5bd2d55ae35de77d66d11cbbf5d0892.mp4?t=1765174059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains multiple fictional historical combat missions. Helps you familiarize and understand game operations and core gameplay in the early stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, it also includes three different difficulty levels of endless modes, where enemies will attack wave after wave, and you can see how long you can lead this giant ship to persist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave of enemies is cleared, a random gain reward will appear, which helps to complete battles more efficiently in subsequent waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to enhancing the work efficiency of ground personnel, the participation and assistance of new models of fighter jets such as J35 and KJ600 can also be obtained.</p>","developers":["Mithril_055"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/ebeb9ea8f19d057207770a6d139db1ba3afd7ddd/header.jpg?t=1765174059","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027740/1783742644/71d36e9f14bc25af38d19dc7ac7ed0872b93aa11/1764336071/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764336867","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027740/1783742644/71d36e9f14bc25af38d19dc7ac7ed0872b93aa11/1764336071/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764336867","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027740/1783742644/71d36e9f14bc25af38d19dc7ac7ed0872b93aa11/1764336071/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764336867","id":257236485,"name":"FuJianStrike-gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236485/72013186f83597f6c9887d4551df0c8290da4436/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764336867"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027740/553802716/eb040844881658